{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Gaster — The Voice\n\nFormer Royal Scientist, shattered across time and space. He never appears in Deltarune, but his trace is everywhere.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Is he the Voice from the intro?**\nToby Fox's tweets as Undertale quote Entry 17 almost verbatim.","x":346,"y":-538,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Clam Girl**\nMentions 'Suzy' a month before the Ch.1 announcement — almost certainly Susie.","x":700,"y":-150,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**666 and the Goners**\nFollowers, Goner Kid, the Vessel — all tagged the same way in the files.","x":700,"y":250,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Man**\nAppears in both worlds and claims to exist «since the dawn of the world».","x":346,"y":550,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Shelter**\nThe static noise tied to him rings at 666% near the Shelter.","x":-130,"y":550,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Undertale Connection**\nOriginal Undertale character; his shadow stretches over all of Deltarune.","x":-606,"y":250,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"4"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Everyman**\nSame '-man' naming pattern in the files; both are linked to the True Lab.","x":-606,"y":-150,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"**Sans and Papyrus**\nAre they the 'you two' from Entry 17? Gaster Blaster, hidden blueprints.","x":-900,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nSame DEVICE_ prefix in the game's files.","x":-900,"y":50,"width":260,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s10","type":"text","text":"**Is Deltarune his experiment?**\nToby Fox called Deltarune an 'experiment' the night before Ch.1.","x":900,"y":600,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_toby_fox_tweets_as_gaster.webp","x":615,"y":-2222,"width":485,"height":1612},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_gonerclampgirl.webp","x":1063,"y":-196,"width":116,"height":170},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_goonerkid.gif","x":1045,"y":361,"width":220,"height":162},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_overworld_tree.gif","x":581,"y":812,"width":198,"height":170},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shelter.png","x":-108,"y":880,"width":220,"height":165},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Undertale.png","x":-869,"y":425,"width":170,"height":170},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/everyman.png","x":-914,"y":-224,"width":220,"height":167},{"id":"s8-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Sans_attack_Gaster_Blaster.png","x":-1164,"y":-718,"width":119,"height":170},{"id":"s9-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-1218,"y":81,"width":183,"height":170},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Entry Number 17**\n'What do you two think?' — his only real text, hidden in Wingdings.","x":-280,"y":-875,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_entry17.jpg","x":-258,"y":-1220,"width":170,"height":170},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":-100,"y":-636,"width":220,"height":566},{"id":"s_cap3","type":"text","text":"**New Ch.3 clues** The missing G when choosing initials, the absence of G/A sounds, the gray with a value of 666, \"crowd/love\" playing 4 times, Northern Light at 66%/Glacier at 1332% — weak coincidences on their own.","x":1180,"y":-538,"width":290,"height":190,"color":"1"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s7","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e8","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e9","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s9","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"s6-img-e","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s7-img-e","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s8-img-e","fromNode":"s8-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s9-img-e","fromNode":"s9-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e10","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s10","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_cap3","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_cap3","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}